msgid "离线平台"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:8
msgid "FreeAnima 卫星壳离线能力按**读/写能力**划分（勿再使用 Tier 编号）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 能力          | 叫法                     | 机制                      | 模块                                   |\n"
"| ------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 只读本地副本  | **snapshot**（只读快照） | IndexedDB KV              | Email、Notification、Habitat、Dream 等 |\n"
"| 可写 + 写队列 | **CRUD outbox**          | outbox + 乐观 KV          | Diary、Task、Project                   |\n"
"| 可写 + 写队列 | **Hybrid outbox**        | outbox + localStorage LWW | Pomodoro（active 计时）                |\n"
"| 可写 + 写队列 | **Stream outbox**        | SAP 流式 flush            | Chat send                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:17
msgid "可写模块统一用 `offlineWritable: true` 标记（outbox 模块）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "词表"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 概念         | 叫法                            | 代码                                                  | 含义                                        |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 只读本地副本 | snapshot                        | `offline-cache` / `withOfflineCache`                  | 栖息地不可用时只读；在线必打 Habitat 并回写 |\n"
"| 可写离线模块 | outbox 模块 / `offlineWritable` | `registerOfflineModuleCap({ offlineWritable: true })` | 离线可改，失败入队，重连 flush              |\n"
"| 写队列条目   | outbox                          | `offline-outbox` / `OfflineOutboxOp`                  | 待同步写操作                                |\n"
"| 写路径形状   | CRUD / Hybrid / Stream          | `kind: \"rpc\"`、Pomodoro LWW、`kind: \"stream\"`         | 如何本地写与如何 flush                      |\n"
"| 在线写优先   | `preferOnlineWrite`             | 同名                                                  | 在线直连 Habitat；仅传输失败回退 outbox     |\n"
"| 推队列       | flush                           | `flushOfflineModule` / `flushAllOfflineModules`       | 把 outbox 打到 Habitat                      |\n"
"| 重连编排     | sync                            | `offline-sync` / `OfflineSyncBootstrap`               | 重连/可见时 flush + 模块 `refreshAll`       |\n"
"| 用户拉视图   | refresh                         | 页头刷新 / pull-to-refresh                            | 与 sync 职责分离                            |\n"
"| 连接状态 UI  | connectivity                    | `connectivity-notice` / `ShellConnectivityBar`        | 断网 vs Habitat 未连；**不是** outbox       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "平台原语（shell-sdk）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid "`offline-cache` — snapshot KV"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid "`offline-outbox` — 跨模块写队列"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid ""
"`offline-id-map` / `offline-temp-id` — 本地负 id → server id；"
"`subscribeIdMappings` 供 UI remap"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid "`offline-module-registry` — Rpc / Stream 双适配器注册"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid ""
"`offline-sync` — 重连/可见时 orchestrator flush + refreshAll；flush 锁尾触"
"发；compact 后删除被吸收的 IDB op"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid ""
"`offline-cache-first` — `withOfflineCache()`：**在线栖息地优先** / 离线只读快"
"照（可与 IDB 并行读作失败回退）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid ""
"`prefer-online-write` — `preferOnlineWrite()`：在线写优先 Habitat RPC；仅网"
"络/传输失败回退 outbox；业务错误直接抛出"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:42
msgid ""
"`habitat-fetch-gate` — `isHabitatFetchAvailable()`：断网 **或** Habitat 非 "
"`connected` 时不发起 Habitat RPC 读/flush，只读 IndexedDB 快照"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "在线栖息地优先 / 离线本地优先"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:46
msgid ""
"`isHabitatFetchAvailable()` = `navigator.onLine !== false` **且** "
"`getHabitatRpcConnectionState() === \"connected\"`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "读"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:52
msgid ""
"栖息地可用：必打 Habitat（缓存命中不短路）；成功后异步写回本地 KV；fetch 失败"
"回退快照"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:52
msgid "栖息地不可用：只读本地；无缓存则抛 offlineError"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:52
msgid ""
"snapshot / outbox 模块 list·get：优先 `withOfflineCache()`；手写路径须同语义"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "写（全体 outbox 模块：在线不入 outbox）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 形状          | 模块                   | 在线                                                                                                                      | 离线 / 传输失败                                              |\n"
"| ------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| CRUD outbox   | Diary / Task / Project | `preferOnlineWrite` → 直连 Habitat RPC（带 `client_op_id`），响应回写本地 KV，**不入 outbox**；create 直接得到服务端正 id | 乐观 KV + outbox + `scheduleFlush`（含仍为未映射的 temp id） |\n"
"| Hybrid outbox | Pomodoro               | `preferOnlineWrite` → Habitat RPC（config / active / session），**不入 outbox**；本地 LWW 仍即时写                        | enqueue outbox，重连 flush                                   |\n"
"| Stream outbox | Chat                   | 栖息地可用：内存 `client_op_id` + 直发 message stream，**不入 outbox**                                                    | enqueue outbox；仅传输失败从在线直发回退入队                 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:63
msgid "业务校验 / 尾冲突等错误抛给 UI，不进「可自动重试」队列"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:63
msgid ""
"模块接线：gate / 错误分流认 sdk（`preferOnlineWrite` / "
"`isRetriableOfflineWriteError`）；不抽泛型 CRUD 框架"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flush / 同步 UI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:71
msgid ""
"`flushOfflineModule` / `flushAllOfflineModules`：gate 为 false 时 no-op，重连"
"后由 `OfflineSyncBootstrap` 触发；flush 锁尾触发"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:71
msgid "自动 flush 连续失败达到 5 次后停止重试"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:71
msgid ""
"**Bootstrap toast**：展示 **failed / stale**（任意连接状态）；纯 **pending** "
"仅在 Habitat **未** `connected` 时展示。`connected` 下正常排队/在线直发不得弹"
"「重新连接并全部重试」"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:71
msgid ""
"失败/冲突 toast：单条 **重试** + **丢弃**；「重连并全部重试」仅用于未连接时的"
"纯 pending toast"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:71
msgid ""
"chat 流式 flush 在离开聊天页时回退到 headless context，全局 bar 仍可 flush"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:73
msgid ""
"写 RPC 可选 `client_op_id`；flush 重试使用同一 id；create 响应含完整 `item` "
"供 id-map 写入。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Temp id 生命周期契约（CRUD outbox）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:77
msgid "create flush 成功后，本地世界里不得再以「裸 temp id」作为查找键："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:83
msgid ""
"**Lookup 前解析**：update / delete / append 若传入 temp id，先经 "
"`getIdMapping` 解析再查本地列表"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:83
msgid ""
"**Flush 后立刻 rewrite KV**：create 成功写 id-map 的同时，把本地列表中的 "
"temp 行改成 server id（不要只靠 `refreshAll` 丢掉 temp）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:83
msgid ""
"**UI remap**：订阅 `subscribeIdMappings`，把选中态 / 列表中的 temp 换成 real"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:83
msgid "**Compact 持久化**：`compactOutbox` 吸收的原始 op 必须从 IDB 删除"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:83
msgid ""
"**Allocator seed**：写前 `seedTempIdAllocatorFromIdMap`，避免刷新后复用仍映射"
"中的负 id"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:85
msgid ""
"在线 write-through create 不产生 temp id，不受本契约约束。Pomodoro（Hybrid）"
"不使用 temp entity id；session 用 `client_op_id` 幂等。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "接入清单"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:93
msgid "Habitat 写 RPC 支持 `client_op_id`（若尚未有）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:93
msgid "实现 `features/<slug>/ui/spa/lib/offline-store.ts`（或 stream adapter）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:93
msgid ""
"`registerOfflineModule(adapter)` + "
"`registerOfflineModuleCap({ offlineWritable: true })`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:93
msgid ""
"`api.ts`：读走 `withOfflineCache`（或同语义）；写委托 offline-store，入口包 "
"`preferOnlineWrite`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:93
msgid "更新 `docs/guide/remote-access.md`（若边界变化）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:95
msgid "冲突策略：单设备；flush 后 refreshAll，以 Habitat 为准。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sync vs page refresh"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/offline-platform.md:98
msgid ""
"`offline-sync` / `OfflineSyncBootstrap` 负责 **sync**（重连与可见时 flush + "
"有 outbox 模块的 `refreshAll`）。用户点「刷新」或下拉刷新是 **refresh**（当前"
"页重新拉取视图），二者职责分离。产品页矩阵与交互约定见 [`docs/features/page-"
"refresh.md`](../features/page-refresh.md)。"
msgstr ""
